      "text": "PRIMARY PRODUCERS\n  (plants, algae)\n         |\n         v\n  PRIMARY CONSUMERS <---- INSECTIVORES (warblers, swallows)\n  (insects, fruits,        GRANIVORES (finches, sparrows)\n   seeds, plants)          FRUGIVORES (toucans, cotingas)\n         |                 NECTARIVORES (hummingbirds, sunbirds)\n         v\n  SECONDARY CONSUMERS <--- INSECTIVORES (higher level)\n  (small vertebrates,      PISCIVORES (herons, kingfishers, terns)\n   insects, fish)          SMALL MAMMAL PREDATORS (raptors)\n         |\n         v\n  APEX PREDATORS <--------- LARGE RAPTORS (eagles, falcons)\n  (medium-large             SCAVENGERS (vultures; \"ecosystem cleaners\")\n   vertebrates)\n         |\n         v\n  DECOMPOSERS <------------- DETRITIVORE BIRDS (low level)\n                             (primarily macroinvertebrates + bacteria)\n```"
