      "text": "CENTRAL PREMISE:\n  Natural selection favors individuals that maximize net energy intake\n  per unit time (or maximize another relevant currency)"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-ECOLOGY-FORAGING.md#009",
      "path": [
        "07-ECOLOGY-FORAGING.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
