        "title": "Ecology and Foraging Strategies",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "E/T ratio = (Energy gained) / (Time spent foraging)\n  Subject to: travel time, search time, handling time, risk"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-ECOLOGY-FORAGING.md#010",
