        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Ecology and Foraging Strategies",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "PREY MODEL (Pulliam 1974):\n  Forager encounters prey types ranked by profitability (E/h)\n  E = energy from prey type i\n  h = handling time for prey type i\n  Decision: include or exclude lower-ranked prey types"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-ECOLOGY-FORAGING.md#011",
      "path": [
        "07-ECOLOGY-FORAGING.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:ornithology:07-ecology-foraging, git-history:ornithology:07-ecology-foraging]",
        "canonical_path": "ornithology/07-ECOLOGY-FORAGING.md",
        "concepts": "[ecology, foraging]",
        "current_path": "ornithology/07-ECOLOGY-FORAGING.md",
        "id": "maxim:ornithology:ecology-foraging",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "ornithology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[ecology, foraging]",
        "section": "ornithology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Ecology and Foraging Strategies",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "KEY PREDICTION: Include lower-ranked prey type ONLY IF:\n    E1/h1 > E1 / (h1 + s1)  (where s = search time for type 1)\n  When type 1 is abundant (short s1): exclude type 2\n  When type 1 is rare (long s1): include type 2"
    },
    {
