      "text": "PERCH-AND-WAIT HUNTERS:\n  Raptors: soar/perch; watch for movement; stoop\n    Red-tailed hawk: perch hunting, roadside utility poles\n    Peregrine: high-altitude patrol; stoop at pigeon speed\n  Herons (Ardeidae): stand motionless; strike with neck spring\n  Kingfishers: perch over water; dive"
    },
